* {{cite web|url=https://recherche-collection-search.bac-lac.gc.ca/eng/home/record?IdNumber=5562&app=rpm|title=RPM 100 Hit Tracks – June 7, 1999|work=RPM|date=July 17, 2013 |publisher=Library and Archives Canada|access-date=May 22, 2021|archive-date=October 13, 2020|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201013031053/https://www.bac-lac.gc.ca/eng/discover/films-videos-sound-recordings/rpm/Pages/image.aspx?Image=nlc008388.8161&URLjpg=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.collectionscanada.gc.ca%2Fobj%2F028020%2Ff4%2Fnlc008388.8161.gif&Ecopy=nlc008388.8161|url-status=live}}
