* {{cite web|url=https://recherche-collection-search.bac-lac.gc.ca/eng/home/record?IdNumber=5948&app=rpm|title=RPM 100 Hit Tracks – July 5, 1999|work=RPM|date=July 17, 2013 |publisher=Library and Archives Canada|access-date=May 22, 2021|archive-date=March 31, 2019|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190331054658/http://www.bac-lac.gc.ca/eng/discover/films-videos-sound-recordings/rpm/Pages/image.aspx?Image=nlc008388.8395&URLjpg=http%3a%2f%2fwww.collectionscanada.gc.ca%2fobj%2f028020%2ff4%2fnlc008388.8395.gif&Ecopy=nlc008388.8395|url-status=live}}
